    {
      "EN": "Old town",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/maps/loc/wall.description#name",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/maps/loc/wall.description"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Masha,\n\nThe keys for the door\nare downstairs,\nask the janitor.\n\nVilen",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/masha.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/masha.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "I left the car at the main entrance\n(fetch the keys from the table at the office).\nThe engine's playing pranks a little bit,\nbut the baby can still make it pretty good.\n\nEnjoy the weekend!\n\nAlexey",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/mashina.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/mashina.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Andrey, we have received a new\nvaccine in sealed metal containers.\n...No details...\nSpecifications and the\napplication guide...\nare in sealed envelopes.\n...I suppose that the serum\nwill be used for vaccination\nof the local population\nin emergency situations.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/sivorodka.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/01med/sivorodka.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "The city is expecting another batch\nof grain...\nThe deadline for the departure of\nthe loaded train is the day after\ntomorrow. We have to work\novertime. And this is the third\nexcess supply! People are so tired\nthat they can barely stand up.\n...no idea why the city stores up\nso much. It looks like they're\ngetting ready for a war...",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/02kolhoz/gorod.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/02kolhoz/gorod.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Something has been wrong with\nthe hens the last few days.\nThey are gaining weight too quickly.\nThey're growing more and more\nby the day.\nMaybe something has\nbeen added to their feed?",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/02kolhoz/kuriWarn.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/02kolhoz/kuriWarn.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "It looks like the coal trains have just\nvanished into thin air.\n\nNot a single supply in the past three\ndays.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/eshelon.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/eshelon.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Everything's upside down here because\nof the state order for the construction of\na secret object.\nNew materials have been delivered, which are\ncapable of withstanding high temperatures and\nradiation. We hadn't dealt with them before,\nand processing methods hadn't been tested.\nQuality control is very strict.\nThe finished products are immediately packed in\ncontainers and transported from the plant\nunder guard.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/probi.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/probi.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Vladimir called on the phone, he was\nvery agitated and started telling me that\nI should give up everything and rush\nto the city at once.\n\nI didn't understand a thing\nand asked him to explain,\nand that's when the connection broke down.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/vladimir.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/03MEAT/vladimir.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "ATTENTION!\nToday Soviet astronomers registered a solar flare of enormous power.\nThis phenomenon may have an influence on people.\nTheir behavior may become unusual, sometimes unpredictable.\nPeople may enter a state of excessive lassitude or become hyperactive.\nWe strongly request your utmost attention to this matter.\nReport any emergency situation immediately!",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/04wall/ActivSun.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/04wall/ActivSun.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Lyudmila, I have no idea what to say to you.\nMy husband's been away round the clock too.\nHe says the damned bosses\nare trying to finish\neverything up before\nthe next Soviet holiday.\nHe doesn't say what they're working on, though.\nIt's been banned.\nThere have been\nstrange rumors going round the town,\nthey make me ill at ease.\nAnd Zina is leaving for\na kolhoz next week. Their\ninstitute has been ordered to help harvest potatoes.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/04wall/liuda.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/04wall/liuda.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "In a world where the workday is short, where no one goes hungry,\nwhere every person lives in a house with a bath and a fridge, owns a car or\neven an airplane, the most obvious and maybe the most important\nform of inequality has already disappeared. Having become common,\nwealth ceases to engender class distinctions",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gorOW.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gorOW.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Curious, isn't it?\nYesterday I felt that the taste of\nthe water has changed...\nI refreshed myself with a glass\nof fizzy water and felt a second\nwind come on.\nMy spirits went high,\nI wanted to work. Aren't these\nthe miraculous transformations\nthat have been talked about so\nmuch lately?",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gorVoda.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gorVoda.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Report\n\nI hereby report that the law-enforcement\nauthorities have been put on red alert.\nThe city's healthcare and social services\nhave received all the necessary instructions.\nThe possibility of using the civil\ndefense system has been taken into account.\n\nE.E. Filonov",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gotovnost.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/05gor/gotovnost.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Act No. 043  Date: 04.06.55\n\nCLASSIFIED\n\nMaterials for the Project 00.56-2:\n\n- newsreel No. 17. General operating\nprinciples of the facility. Goals of\nthe experiment;\n- video record of the completion of the\nfacility construction;\n- report of the chief designer (excerpt).\n\nSignature:",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/06GRSVT/dliababini.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/06GRSVT/dliababini.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "They are trying to boost the capacity\nso that the emission will cover\nthe largest area possible...\nIn fact, the facility is working in\ncritical mode, so breakdowns\nare inevitable...\nIt is urgently necessary to launch\nthe production of the elements that break\ndown most often.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/detali.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/detali.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "INSTRUCTION\n\nDue to the start of the preparation tests,\nunforeseen changes in human behavior are\npossible. Increased aggression or the\nreverse, sudden apathy, may be observed.\nIt is necessary to come up with a simple\nand comprehensive explanation for this\nbeforehand. For instance, magnetic storms\nor solar activity may be to blame.\nThis information must be circulated\nas widely as possible.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/podgovSunActiv.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/podgovSunActiv.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "That shrieking...\nThe sound of the tram rails is\ndriving me out of my mind.\n\nI'm gonna complain to the city\nexecs committee",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/tramvai.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/07GorKonec/tramvai.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Gone to the\nlower yard.\n\nBack in an\nhour.\n\nYard-keeper",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/dvornik.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/dvornik.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Comrades,\n\nThe yard gate\nis closed for the night!\nContact the yard-keeper\nin case of need.\n\nHousing Dept",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/jilci.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/jilci.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "What a wonderful day today!\nVladilen finally made up his mind\nand invited me to the cinema!\nI haven't given him my 'yes' yet.\nWell... At least\nthe way back isn't long.\nThe cinema's just round the corner.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/lolita.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/08POH/lolita.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "I wonder why there've been these\nspeculations about giant rats again.\nThey say a brigade\nwas attacked in Sector 4\nwhen they were working in a tunnel.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/KrisiWarn.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/KrisiWarn.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Ask the\nprojectionist\nfor the basement keys!",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/kinoKey.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/kinoKey.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "You are coming late again!\nDon't forget to replace the lamp\nbefore the performance.\n\nFetch it from the storehouse\nin the basement.\nThe key to the basement is on the table.\n\nKolya",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/opiat.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/09Kinostreet/opiat.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Instruction No. 8   Date: 21.X-7\n\nTO THE STATION PERSONNEL\n\nEscalator power supply can be\nturned off at the auxiliary\nsubstation.\nAccess the substation from the\nleft platform.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/10Metro/Eskalator.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/10Metro/Eskalator.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Order No. 19\nTime: 1:07 p.m.\nDate: Septmeber 19, ___.\n\nRef: Passage of Train P-1\n\nORDER ABOUT THE TRAIN PASSAGE\n\nI hereby order flawless passage of\nthe train through the stations of\nKomsomolskaya, Universitet and\nStalinskaya.\nThe speed of the train is at least\n40 km/h on main and station tracks and\nat least 15 km/h on track switches.\nManeuvers at the stations are to be\nexecuted using semi-automatic signals.\nShould these fail, signals of the\npersonnel on-duty are to be used.\nThe movement of the train is controlled\nby Department Two\nof the State Security Service.\n\nMajor Tarasenko\nResponsible Official",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/10Metro/WarnVagon.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/10Metro/WarnVagon.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "A military inspection\nsurprised us yesterday.\nThey checked shelters intended for\na nuclear war. We had abandoned and\nforgotten about them, and you could\nsee this from the condition they were in.\nOur command got a roasting.\nWe were ordered to put everything\nto rights as soon as possible\nand renew the supplies of water, food\nand other necessary provisions.\n\nI don't even dare to think\nwhat this may all mean.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/11met6/revizia.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/11met6/revizia.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Sometimes I think that the world around us\nis just an illusion. And the quality of this illusion,\nits vibe, depends only on ourselves.\nIf your views are not sophisticated,\nthe world around you will be simple and unelaborate.\nIf you're depraved and lost, if you're walking\nblind in the dark, the world will be\nempty and senseless. The reality around us\nis nothing more than a reflection of\nour own essence. If you\nwant to change the world, start with yourself.",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/12opera/eliuzia.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/12opera/eliuzia.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "The new receiver is working fine.\nFollowing advice, I went up to the roofs trying to find\na place with minimal jamming, and I occasionally\nintercepted a message. It dealt with the launch\nof an underground power plant.\nThey said about unforeseen difficulties,\nregardless of which some experiment\nwould still take",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/13krovli/radioLiubitel.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/13krovli/radioLiubitel.tga"
    },
    {
      "EN": "Before\nrolling the\ntransport out\n\nCheck the\nturntable pit.\n\nChief Mech",
      "batch": "batch-0001.jsonl",
      "id": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/14parall/yama.tga#letter",
      "kind": "added",
      "previous_EN": null,
      "previous_PTBR": "",
      "source_file": "gameres/textures/Zapiski/14parall/yama.tga"
    },
    {
